  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1455\" data-end=\"1595\">\n<p data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1480\"><strong data-start=\"1457\" data-end=\"1478\">ER &amp; PR Positive:</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1595\">\n<li data-start=\"1483\" data-end=\"1595\">\n<p data-start=\"1485\" data-end=\"1595\">Suggests hormone-driven tumor; may benefit from <strong data-start=\"1533\" data-end=\"1554\">endocrine therapy</strong> (e.g., tamoxifen, aromatase inhibitors).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1743\">\n<p data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1628\"><strong data-start=\"1599\" data-end=\"1626\">HER2/neu 3+ (Positive):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1743\">\n<li data-start=\"1631\" data-end=\"1743\">\n<p data-start=\"1633\" data-end=\"1743\">Indicates <strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1670\">HER2 gene amplification</strong>; eligible for <strong data-start=\"1685\" data-end=\"1742\">HER2-targeted therapy (trastuzumab, pertuzumab, etc.)</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1745\" data-end=\"1849\">\n<p data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1777\"><strong data-start=\"1747\" data-end=\"1775\">HER2/neu 2+ (Equivocal):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1849\">\n<li data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1849\">\n<p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1849\">Requires <strong data-start=\"1791\" data-end=\"1816\">confirmatory FISH/ISH</strong> to determine gene amplification.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1851\" data-end=\"1999\">\n<p data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1893\"><strong data-start=\"1853\" data-end=\"1891\">Triple Negative (ER-, PR-, HER2-):</strong></p>\n<ul data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1999\">\n<li data-start=\"1896\" data-end=\"1999\">\n<p data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1999\">Suggests <strong data-start=\"1907\" data-end=\"1946\">non-hormonal, non-HER2-driven tumor</strong>, may need chemotherapy or novel targeted approaches.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
